#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Power-profiles-daemon"
msgstr "Instalação do Power-profiles-daemon"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:123
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Power-profiles-daemon</application> by running the "
"following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>Power-profiles-daemon</application> executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:126
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup                       \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr               \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release         \\\n"
"      -Dgtk_doc=false             \\\n"
"      -Dtests=false               \\\n"
"      -Dsystemdsystemunitdir=/tmp \\\n"
"      .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup                       \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr               \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release         \\\n"
"      -Dgtk_doc=false             \\\n"
"      -Dtests=false               \\\n"
"      -Dsystemdsystemunitdir=/tmp \\\n"
"      .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:139
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup               \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release \\\n"
"      -Dgtk_doc=false     \\\n"
"      -Dtests=false       \\\n"
"      .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup               \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release \\\n"
"      -Dgtk_doc=false     \\\n"
"      -Dtests=false       \\\n"
"      .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:151
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have installed the external dependencies, to test the results issue: "
"<command> ninja test</command>."
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver instalado as dependências externas, para testar os resultados,"
" emita: <command> ninja test</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:156
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:159
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:162
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, clean up an unneeded systemd unit installed into /tmp:"
msgstr "Agora, limpe uma unidade do systemd desnecessária instalada em /tmp:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:166
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>rm -fv /tmp/power-profiles-daemon.service</userinput>\n"
msgstr "<userinput>rm -fv /tmp/power-profiles-daemon.service</userinput>\n"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:170
#, xml-text
msgid "Create a directory required for persistant power states after reboot:"
msgstr ""
"Crie um diretório exigido para estados persistentes de eletricidade depois "
"de reinicialização:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:175
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>install -vdm755 /var/lib/power-profiles-daemon</userinput>\n"
msgstr "<userinput>install -vdm755 /var/lib/power-profiles-daemon</userinput>\n"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:182
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:185
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dgtk_doc=false</parameter>: Prevents building the documentation."
" Remove this if you have <application>GTK-Doc</application> installed and "
"wish to build the documentation."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dgtk_doc=false</parameter>: Impede construir a documentação. "
"Remova isso se você tiver o <application>GTK-Doc</application> instalado e "
"desejar construir a documentação."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:191
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dtests=false</parameter>: Prevents building the tests because "
"they cannot be run within the boundaries of BLFS.  Remove this if you have "
"installed the external dependencies and wish to run the tests."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dtests=false</parameter>: Impede construir os testes porque eles"
" não podem ser executados dentro dos limites do BLFS. Remova isso se você "
"tiver instalado as dependências externas e desejar executar os testes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:198
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dsystemdsystemunitdir=/tmp</parameter>: Removes the dependency "
"on <application>systemd</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dsystemdsystemunitdir=/tmp</parameter>: Remove a dependência em "
"relação ao <application>systemd</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:205
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Power-profiles-daemon"
msgstr "Configurando Power-profiles-daemon"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:208
#, xml-text
msgid "Boot Script"
msgstr "Conjunto de Comandos Sequenciais de Inicialização"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:211
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To automatically start the <command>power-profiles-daemon</command> when the"
" system is rebooted, install the <filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/power-profiles-"
"daemon</filename> bootscript from the <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\" "
"revision=\"sysv\"/> as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> "
"user:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar automaticamente o <command>power-profiles-daemon</command> "
"quando o sistema for reinicializado, instale o conjunto de comandos "
"sequenciais de inicialização <filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/power-profiles-"
"daemon</filename>, a partir do <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\" "
"revision=\"sysv\"/>, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:222
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install-power-profiles-daemon</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-power-profiles-daemon</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:227
#, xml-text
msgid "Systemd Unit"
msgstr "Unidade do Systemd"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:230
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To start the power-profiles-daemon on boot, enable the systemd service that "
"was installed by running the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar o power-profiles-daemon na inicialização, habilite o serviço de"
" systemd que foi instalado executando o seguinte comando como o(a) "
"usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:235
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>systemctl enable power-profiles-daemon</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>systemctl enable power-profiles-daemon</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:239
#, xml-text
msgid "Select a Power Profile"
msgstr "Selecione um Perfil de Eletricidade"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:242
#, xml-text
msgid "To list all supported power profiles, issue:"
msgstr "Para listar todos os perfis de eletricidade suportados, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:245
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>powerprofilesctl</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>powerprofilesctl</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:248
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To activate a power profile (for example "
"<replaceable>performance</replaceable>), issue:"
msgstr ""
"Para ativar um perfil de eletricidade (por exemplo "
"<replaceable>performance</replaceable>), emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:252
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>powerprofilesctl set "
"<replaceable>performance</replaceable></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>powerprofilesctl set "
"<replaceable>performance</replaceable></userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:255
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Some desktop environments (for example GNOME and KDE) also provide a "
"graphical interface to interact with <command>power-profiles-"
"daemon</command> and activate a power profile."
msgstr ""
"Alguns ambientes de área de trabalho (por exemplo GNOME e KDE) também "
"fornecem uma interface gráfica para interagir com <command>power-profiles-"
"daemon</command> e ativar um perfil de eletricidade."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/power-profiles-daemon.xml:262
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The activated power profile is automatically stored in "
"<filename>/var/lib/power-profiles-daemon/state.ini</filename> and "
"<command>power-profiles-daemon</command> will read it out and activate it "
"again on the next boot if the <phrase revision='sysv'>bootscript is "
"installed</phrase><phrase revision='systemd'>Systemd unit is "
"enabled</phrase> as above."
msgstr ""
"O perfil de eletricidade ativado é automaticamente armazenado em "
"<filename>/var/lib/power-profiles-daemon/state.ini</filename> e "
"<command>power-profiles-daemon</command> irá lê-lo e ativá-lo novamente na "
"próxima inicialização se <phrase revision='sysv'>o conjunto de comandos "
"sequenciais de inicialização estiver instalado</phrase><phrase "
"revision='systemd'>a unidade do Systemd estiver habilitada</phrase> como "
"acima."

